00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:54.400
Want to know a secret about the word cosmos? Did you know that the Russian word cosmos in the English word cosmos are actually the same word? They both come from the ancient Greek word cosmos.

00:05:55.520 --> 00:06:04.200
This meant order or the orangishest universe. The word travel through Latin into Russian during the time of Peter the Great in 1700s.

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:13.660
English picked it up around the same era from scholars, but here is a fun connection. It shares a road with the word cosmetic, which means cosmetics.

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:17.760
Both ideas come from making things orderly and beautiful.

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:27.300
So next time you see the word cosmos or think about the universe, remember this family connection that you secret short cut to remembering it forever.

